   "speaker": "Stuart Robert",
   "party": "LNP",
   "state": "federal",
   "date": "2020-12-09",
   "stage_hint": null,
   "brief": "The Data Availability and Transparency (Consequential Amendments) Bill amends the ASIO Act, the ADJR Act, the Privacy Act and the FOI Act to support the principal data sharing scheme, including allowing ASIO to advise on accreditation, limiting foreign entities' notice and review rights, enabling complaint transfers between commissioners, and preserving FOI protections for shared data."
  }
